{"id": 47, "ts": 1780083003.0355208, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 3, "agent": "agent_3", "message": "I appreciate the clarification on Candidate\u202fB\u2019s crew\u2011cooperation record. The fact that we have no concrete examples of B working well with a crew\u2014and even a note that B \u201ccan be uncooperative\u201d\u2014directly undermines the cooperation criterion, which is essential for long\u2011distance operations. In contrast, Candidate\u202fC has already demonstrated a positive crew atmosphere and 100\u202f% reliability, and we have multiple strengths (calmness under pressure, rapid correct decisions). While C\u2019s communication style is a concern, the lack of any crew\u2011cooperation evidence for B is a more decisive shortfall. Therefore, I now align with Agents\u202f1 and\u202f2 and recommend Candidate\u202fC."}
